{"unit_id":"MistRain-1__dsh-reconnect#card-zh","repo":"MistRain-1/dsh-reconnect","commit":"168b0dd51baca08088b300441bf5a9833fb866c4","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reconnect（DSH 插件，网页客户端）：为 DeepSeek Harness 的模型请求失败提供自动恢复。它监听 Host 的 agent/request-error 事件，并在适用错误后按策略重发请求。主要功能包括临时网络或服务错误重试、模型暂不可用时等待恢复、指数退避并尊重 Provider Retry-After，以及在设置页调整重试选项。适合希望长任务能跨越短暂模型服务故障的 DSH 用户。需要 DSH Host 与 settings 服务，不需要额外 API Key 或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:282-374","src/client.js:187-307","package.json:10-20"]}
{"unit_id":"MistRain-1__dsh-reconnect#card-en","repo":"MistRain-1/dsh-reconnect","commit":"168b0dd51baca08088b300441bf5a9833fb866c4","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-reconnect (DSH web plugin) retries failed model requests through the Host error event. It handles temporary failures, uses exponential backoff and Provider Retry-After, and offers retry controls in the settings page. It needs the DSH Host and settings service.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:282-374","src/client.js:187-307","package.json:10-20"]}
