{"unit_id":"MistRain-1__dsh-reconnect#feature-temporary-errors","repo":"MistRain-1/dsh-reconnect","commit":"168b0dd51baca08088b300441bf5a9833fb866c4","type":"feature","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-reconnect 的功能「临时故障重试」：遇到超时、限流、传输中断或服务端错误时，在等待后重发模型请求，并记录重试事件。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:31-39","src/index.js:285-358"]}
